  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5901.77 Patient record",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5901.77 “Patient record” means any document which is part of EMSIR, including confidential information, prepared from direct interviews with patients, written statements, recordings of vital signs and other medically related documentation generated during the activities of providers in the delivery of emergency medical services at the scene and during transport.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at Chapter heading for Saf-C 5900) #12790, eff 5-24-19",
